                                "sense_id": "016c1ba7-ea91-3e49-9f40-d731fead5727",
                                "text": "Ondanks haar vele talenten, had ze enkele tekortkomingen die ze wilde verbeteren.",
                                "translation": "Despite her many talents, she had some shortcomings that she wanted to improve.",
                                "english": "Despite her many talents, she had some shortcomings that she wanted to improve."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "374666b0-5dac-34ca-9369-e1f40428d9f3",
